---

This project embeds libghostty (https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty),
MIT licensed, Copyright (c) Ghostty contributors. `vendor/Ghostty.metallib`
is a prebuilt Metal shader library extracted from an official Ghostty
release (same version as the vendored source) because the macOS Command
Line Tools ship no `metal` compiler.

Event-translation logic in src/shim.m and src/main.rs is adapted from
Ghostty's own AppKit surface code (MIT).
